1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,293
Results are live. Aarav Sharma signs in on the school's portal with his enrollment number and the password he chose.

2
00:00:10,036 --> 00:00:15,072
The bell shows a new notification: his Periodic Test 1 results are available.

3
00:00:15,836 --> 00:00:19,649
His home page shows the latest result, and whether he passed.

4
00:00:22,101 --> 00:00:29,374
He opens it: his percentage, his overall grade, and the marks for every subject, component by component.

5
00:00:30,084 --> 00:00:36,548
The student portal can also be read in Hindi. Choose it from Language; the choice stays on this device.

6
00:00:38,415 --> 00:00:43,985
Below is the official PDF marksheet. Download saves it to the phone or computer.

7
00:00:46,245 --> 00:00:52,872
Every marksheet has a verification link and code. A college or anyone else can check that it is genuine.

8
00:00:55,169 --> 00:01:04,891
Here is that check, with no account needed. It says Valid, and shows the file's fingerprint. Names are partly hidden, and marks are never shown here.

9
00:01:06,979 --> 00:01:15,997
There is no separate parent login. Parents, like Mr. Anil Sharma, see results with their child, or receive the PDF marksheet.

10
00:01:18,266 --> 00:01:21,502
Next, the plan, usage and school settings.
